    "$comment": "ADR-239. Summer -> Fall -> Winter -> Spring, lengthDays in-game days each (15 since ADR-261; 0 = seasons off). The last blendDays of a season blend visuals, temperature and the weather table into the next. Temperature = blended (meanTemp + dayNightAmplitude * day curve + dailyVariation * per-day noise), clamped to tempRange, + weather tempOffset * intensity + bandScale * (biome band temp - baseTemp) - altitude lapse. Task 23: tempRange is the season's range in deg C (summer 70-88F, fall 36-69F, winter 0-35F, spring 43-68F); rain/storm may cool below it, heat waves clamp into heatWaveRange (summer 89-100F). Season weather entries reference environment.weather kinds (effects come from there) and may override durationSeconds / intensity / windSpeed / tempOffset. Snow kinds are rejected in summer and spring (heat waves too in spring), and snow/blizzard never roll while the seasonal base temperature is at or above freezing (0C / 32F). The year runs Summer -> Fall -> Winter -> Spring -> Summer (Spring = season 3; spring 43-68F, rain/overcast/clear/windy/light fog; crops and wild plants resume growth at the start of spring).",
